THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE IN GENEA

Genea is built with the open-source software listed below: every Rust crate
in the app with the licence Genea uses it under, then the full text of each
licence, then the software that isn't a crate.

Genea's user interface is made with Slint (https://slint.dev), used under the
Slint Royalty-free Desktop, Mobile, and Web Applications License 2.0.

Crates that are under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 are used unmodified. As
that licence requires, their source code is available from the repository
listed beside them and from crates.io.

